# ── Option A: private sheet (recommended) ───────────────────────────────
# The whole service-account key as ONE line of JSON.
# Create it in Google Cloud → IAM → Service Accounts → Keys → JSON,
# then share the spreadsheet with the key's client_email as Viewer.
GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON='{"type":"service_account","project_id":"...","private_key":"-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\n...\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----\n","client_email":"...@....iam.gserviceaccount.com"}'

# ── Option B: sheet published to the web ────────────────────────────────
# File → Share → Publish to web → pick the tab → Comma-separated values.
# Only use this if you are happy for anyone with the URL to read the sheet.
# SHEET_CSV_HOSP=https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/.../pub?gid=0&single=true&output=csv
# SHEET_CSV_DOC=https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/.../pub?gid=1&single=true&output=csv
